<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi missiles have struck Riyadh airport again, killing twelve and wounding many, while U.S. forces disabled a cargo vessel attempting to breach a blockade in the Gulf of Oman. Iran warned of an environmental disaster and signaled a shift in its nuclear doctrine, and the IRGC responded to a supertanker mine strike, extending combat into Iranian waters. The conflict now includes direct maritime confrontations in addition to proxy attacks on Saudi airspace. 123 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261012-houthi-strike-riyadh-airport-yemen&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168559&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQLXNhN1pHTVFkMDM2M21lOXNtYnpXRzRvOEtkVU9pdG1YSXo2Q0M4eVNreElGaFI3RlZZV3FQZXBDZmYtTDYwNVJrbFZOY2VOZWFOR3l2TFpORElhZDhrUWxCRXM1RXpKbGowTVdsS3N0VUIwRFhJOF9wcFhlT1JvRE95dF9BNWluc25GZG1fMm9Gem9NVHN5SlJfNHFXdnprMkxwcktuTjFqOHBYb29lUXpLTE56MjRmbnp6OGU2MzNDNk0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPR094dC1TQTlURWVUOFpLQUc0a1kxa1cwM1h5aDQ3bmxzdk9jdk50VU9UaEVNbjFtVHpWNGZ5STNpeFB2RlJBUGxheVYza29vbnowUXMzYUh5VmVzTVR2WjhFQjU5M0RlZE9DWkI0UGtCZDEtMF9wUG9vcmtPalI1REsxYXNOYzhNNTJmaGh6Y2tVdVF6Z2F2WXdWMHEtbC11R1dXdnpyZmhkZmQtNWNpZFBvM2tkeS01WC1oRVVfRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/1d85912b-7a70-4ba1-87df-3b683adee91e?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/11/world/middleeast/saudi-yemen-airports-houthis.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot